<body>

<h1>Platform Onboarding &amp; Subscription Plans Update Summary</h1>
<p>This document details the recent functional updates completed on the onboarding flow, settings dashboard, navigation layout, and individual subscription plans to align with the product roadmap.</p>

<div class="info-box">
  <strong>Destination Folder:</strong> <code>/Users/mymovies/Documents/IGENews App</code><br>
  <strong>File Name:</strong> <code>platform_onboarding_and_plans_update.doc</code>
</div>

<h2>1. Onboarding Wizard Simplification</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Previous Flow:</strong> 4 steps (Sectors, Countries, Leaders, and Primary Account Type selection).</li>
  <li><strong>Updated Flow:</strong> Reduced to <span class="highlight">3 steps</span> (Sectors, Countries, and Leaders).</li>
  <li><strong>Default Plan:</strong> Step 4 (Primary Account Selection) has been completely removed. The onboarding outcome now automatically defaults the user's role/account type to the <span class="highlight">Free Reader Plan</span> upon completing Step 3.</li>
  <li><strong>Platform Landing:</strong> Once the user completes Step 3, they directly land on the main news feed dashboard.</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. Dashboard Sidebar Navigation Cleanup</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Retained Items:</strong> Profile, My News, Settings (these are the core sections).</li>
  <li><strong>Removed Items:</strong> Authority, Events, and Messages sections have been deleted from the navigation items.</li>
  <li><strong>New Category Added:</strong> A separate navigation block titled <span class="highlight">MEMBERSHIPS &amp; PLANS</span> has been added below the core items. It contains the following 5 upgrade segments:
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Upgrade</strong> (links to Reader Plans)</li>
      <li><strong>Subject Matter Expert - SME</strong> (links to SME Plans)</li>
      <li><strong>Associate SME</strong> (links to Associate SME Plans)</li>
      <li><strong>Company</strong> (links to Company Page Plans)</li>
      <li><strong>Leader</strong> (links to Leader Page Plans)</li>
    </ol>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Responsive View:</strong> On mobile interfaces, only the core items (Profile, My News, Settings) are visible in the bottom navigation bar to keep the screen uncluttered.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Settings Page Update</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Removed Component:</strong> The <span class="highlight">Account Type &amp; Role</span> tab and its role-combination cards have been removed from the Settings panel.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Interactive checkout &amp; Subscription Plans Matrix</h2>
<p>Each of the five plan pages has been created with custom details and integrates a simulated secure checkout drawer (Card, UPI, NetBanking payment flow) which updates the user's profile state on success.</p>

<h3>1. Upgrade (Reader Plans)</h3>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Plan</th>
      <th>Suggested Pricing</th>
      <th>Key Benefits</th>
      <th>Restrictions</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Free Reader</strong> (Current default)</td>
      <td>₹0</td>
      <td>Access to sector headlines, follow sectors, save articles, basic profile, limited daily news.</td>
      <td>No premium reports, no exclusive SME articles, no AI deep intelligence.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Pro Reader</strong></td>
      <td>₹299/mo or ₹2,999/yr</td>
      <td>Unlimited reading, premium SME articles, monthly sector reports, watcher lists, personalized feed.</td>
      <td>None</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Pro Plus / Enterprise</strong></td>
      <td>₹999/mo or custom</td>
      <td>Deep sector intelligence reports, trade reports, enterprise dashboards, AI research assistant, multi-user.</td>
      <td>None</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

